# Assets

## lib.js

```js
// lib.js
var foo = "foo";
var bar = "bar";
var baz = "baz";

export { bar, baz, foo };

```

## main.js

```js
// main.js
const lib = await import("./lib.js");
lib.foo;
await import("./lib.js");
lib.bar;
(await import("./lib.js"))["baz"];
await import("./lib.js");

```
